.br
\fBmokutil\fR [\fB--list-enrolled\fR | \fB-l\fR] [\fB--mok\fR | \fB-m\fR | \fB--mokx\fR | \fB-X\fR] [\fB--short\fR] [\fB--all\fR | \fB-a\fR]
.br
